<title>USA: Gartner to buy back up to 1.8 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Gartner to buy back up to 1.8 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gartner Group Inc said Wednesday that its board has authorized the repurchase of up to 1.8 million shares of its class A common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the repurchase program is intended to offset the dilutive effect of its stock-based employee compensation plans.</p>
<p>It said the buybacks will be executed through open market transactions, purchase agreements and similar strategies.</p>
<p>The company had 93.8 million shares outstanding as of December 31.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
